# Small permutation tables for the marked A₄ edge

The table is indexed by the actual alternating group on four letters.
Each row has a word in the two concrete endpoint generators. Evaluation on
the displayed four-point orbit supplies an inverse to the eventual embedding.
`Edge.lean` checks the words and multiplication; these definitions assert no
unverified group facts. Generated by `source/generate.py` from ATLAS J2G1-p100B0.
-/

